@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = local-development-key

### Health check (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Create a product document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productCode": "EDGE-100",
  "name": "Edge Switch Installation Guide",
  "description": "Installation and safety documentation for the EDGE-100 switch"
}

### Search product documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?query=edge&page=0&size=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get a product document (replace the UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Add an immutable version (replace the UUID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/versions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storageKey": "products/EDGE-100/install-guide-v1.pdf",
  "checksum": "0b7d9b15e9b65f9e1494e1f5d90b1b962c00dd794d5ee4b7c686b95a44bc80d5",
  "contentType": "application/pdf",
  "sizeBytes": 84512,
  "createdBy": "sharma.tanmay4002@gmail.com"
}

### List version history (replace the UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/versions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
